  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 110,
    "summary": "A messianic psalm of David—Christ will sit on the Lord’s right hand—He will be a priest forever after the order of Melchizedek.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "The Lord said unto my Lord, Sit thou at my right hand, until I make thine enemies thy footstool.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 8,
            "text": "Mark 12:36; Luke 20:42."
          },
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 26,
            "text": "Acts 2:34."
          },
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "Heb. 1:13."
          },
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 53,
            "text": "TG Celestial Glory."
          },
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 81,
            "text": "TG Enemies."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord shall send the rod of thy strength out of Zion: rule thou in the midst of thine enemies.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "Isa. 11:1; 53:2 (1–3); D&C 113:3 (3–4)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Thy people shall be willing in the day of thy power, in the beauties of holiness from the womb of the morning: thou hast the dew of thy youth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 19
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord hath sworn, and will not repent, Thou art a priest for ever after the order of Melchizedek.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "TG Oath."
          },
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "1 Sam. 15:35; Ps. 135:14."
          },
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 59,
            "text": "TG High Priest, Melchizedek Priesthood; Jesus Christ, Prophecies about; Priesthood, Melchizedek."
          },
          {
            "start": 88,
            "end": 99,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Types of, in Anticipation."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 50
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord at thy right hand shall strike through kings in the day of his wrath.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall judge among the heathen, he shall fill the places with the dead bodies; he shall wound the heads over many countries.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 58
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall drink of the brook in the way: therefore shall he lift up the head.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
